Title: Ballerina Programming Language
- Ballerina is an open-source, cloud-native programming language.
- It is optimized for integration and supports network protocols and data formats like JSON and XML.
- The language has built-in support for concurrency.
- It includes abstractions for working with large language models, agents, and retrieval-augmented generation.
